<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Jabil trades higher.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Jabil trades higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jabil Circuit Inc's share rose $2-7/8 to $35 in after-hours trading in an otherwise quiet session, traders said Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The company reported earlier in the day higher first-quarter earnings per share of $0.47 against $0.31 for the same period last year.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said its session one volume was 8,500 shares. There was no session two volume, it said.</p>
